  "stem": "A preterm baby in the neonatal intensive care unit was noticed to have bile aspirates through his NG tube, abdominal distension and blood in the stools. Abdominal X-rays in supine and lateral horizontal beam views are performed. Given the clinical data and the X-ray findings, what is the most likely diagnosis?",
